WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.160
Push a heavy box across a
rough floor, then let go.

2
00:00:04.210 --> 00:00:06.720
It slides a little way and stops.

3
00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:10.940
It looks as if moving things need
a force just to keep them going.

4
00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:15.230
Now imagine an object where
every force is matched exactly.

5
00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:17.630
Each push balanced by a pull.

6
00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:20.180
The total force: zero.

7
00:00:20.230 --> 00:00:22.760
Can that object be moving fast?

8
00:00:22.810 --> 00:00:26.310
In this mission, you'll hold a
block still on a rough slope,

9
00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:29.090
and split its weight into two parts.

10
00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:32.090
Then you'll balance three
forces on a hanging lamp,

11
00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:34.310
by drawing them tip to tail.

12
00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:38.780
Your mission: decide whether something
can move fast when all the forces on it

13
00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:39.550
cancel.
